IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q22-BRANCH-REPORT.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT BRANCH-FILE ASSIGN TO "BRANCH.DAT"
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS WS-FILE-STATUS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD BRANCH-FILE.
01 BRANCH-RECORD PIC X(30).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-FILE-STATUS PIC XX.
01 WS-EOF PIC X VALUE 'N'.
01 WS-BRANCH PIC X(3).
01 WS-PREV-BRANCH PIC X(3).
01 WS-AMOUNT-TEXT PIC X(10).
01 WS-AMOUNT PIC 9(9).
01 WS-GROUP-TOTAL PIC 9(12) VALUE 0.
01 WS-GRAND-TOTAL PIC 9(12) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    OPEN INPUT BRANCH-FILE
    IF WS-FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
        DISPLAY "FILE OPEN ERROR: " WS-FILE-STATUS
        STOP RUN
    END-IF
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
        READ BRANCH-FILE
            AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END
                MOVE SPACES TO WS-BRANCH WS-AMOUNT-TEXT
                UNSTRING BRANCH-RECORD DELIMITED BY ALL SPACE
                    INTO WS-BRANCH WS-AMOUNT-TEXT
                END-UNSTRING
                COMPUTE WS-AMOUNT = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-AMOUNT-TEXT)
                IF WS-PREV-BRANCH = SPACES
                    MOVE WS-BRANCH TO WS-PREV-BRANCH
                ELSE
                    IF WS-BRANCH NOT = WS-PREV-BRANCH
                        DISPLAY "Branch " WS-PREV-BRANCH ": " WS-GROUP-TOTAL
                        MOVE 0 TO WS-GROUP-TOTAL
                        MOVE WS-BRANCH TO WS-PREV-BRANCH
                    END-IF
                END-IF
                ADD WS-AMOUNT TO WS-GROUP-TOTAL
                ADD WS-AMOUNT TO WS-GRAND-TOTAL
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    IF WS-PREV-BRANCH NOT = SPACES
        DISPLAY "Branch " WS-PREV-BRANCH ": " WS-GROUP-TOTAL
    END-IF
    DISPLAY "Grand total: " WS-GRAND-TOTAL
    CLOSE BRANCH-FILE
    STOP RUN.
